---
/**
 * The Language global (06). A static build renders each story once, so the story is rendered in
 * both languages, each in an inert <template>; `sb-language` (preview.ts) stamps the one that
 * matches the root's `lang` whenever the story is put on the page.
 */
---
<sb-language>
  <template data-lang="en"><slot name="en" /></template>
  <template data-lang="ja"><slot name="ja" /></template>
</sb-language>
